From 257082a0abd172cab0f2e33b7208103ba5c4baf2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dev <dev@example.local>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:18:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add passwordAge pipe

Formats the time since a date as a short localized age ("Today",
"3 days", "5 months", "2 years"), counting whole calendar days, months
and years. A static getAgeInDays helper exposes the same calculation for
callers that need to compare an age against a threshold.

Also set up a Node-based jasmine runner (`npm test`) for unit tests in
src/**/*.spec.ts, compiled with ts-node and resolving the jslib path
alias through tsconfig-paths. Spec files are excluded from the app
tsconfig so the webpack builds don't pick them up.

package-lock.json still needs to be refreshed with `npm install` for the
new devDependencies.
